<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight rates narrow, one-week steady.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight rates narrow, one-week steady.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian pound overnight interbank rates narrowed on Thursday in a very liquid private sector market to between 10 and 10 1/8 percent from 10 and 10 1/4 percent on Wednesday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates on the pound were steady at 10 1/8 and 10 1/4 percent.</p>
<p>Public sector banks still maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
</text>
